<title>NETHERLANDS: Unilever declines comment on ICI talk.</title>
<headline>Unilever declines comment on ICI talk.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unilever NV/Plc on Wednesday declined to comment on a newspaper report that it was poised to announce the sale of its speciality chemicals unit to Britain's Imperial Chemical Industries Plc.</p>
<p>&quot;At this stage we cannot say anything,&quot; a Unilever spokesman in Rotterdam said.</p>
</text>
